{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-regularity-breakdown-table-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:regularity-breakdown-table-data","kind":"table","title":"Data table from conj:regularity-breakdown","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-regularity-breakdown"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"regularity-breakdown-table-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"tbl:regularity-breakdown-table-data\"></a>\n<strong>Table.</strong> <em>Data table from conj:regularity-breakdown</em></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Statistical mechanics</th>\n<th><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-Navier--Stokes</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Temperature <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T</code></td>\n<td>Substrate parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Critical point <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_c</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q = 1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Order parameter (magnetisation)</td>\n<td>Enstrophy <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Omega(q)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Correlation length <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xi \\to \\infty</code></td>\n<td>Cascade depth <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">N_{\\mathrm{eff}} \\to \\infty</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T > T_c</code>: disordered (no magnet)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q > 1</code>: regular (finite enstrophy)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T &#x3C; T_c</code>: ordered (spontaneous magnet)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q &#x3C; 1</code>: non-physical (no contact structure)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Critical exponents</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha</code>, to be computed from <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-integer asymptotics</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n"}
